WEBVTT

00:01.209 --> 00:02.502
In the year 850,

00:03.336 --> 00:07.882
the Colossal Titan reappeared
and demolished another wall.

00:08.258 --> 00:11.886
Once again, humanity allowed
the Titans to further their advance.

00:13.096 --> 00:16.516
One after another,
soldiers fell to the Titans.

00:17.267 --> 00:18.184
And then...

00:18.852 --> 00:19.686
Eren!

00:20.020 --> 00:20.854
Hurry!

00:28.486 --> 00:30.989
Eren fell prey to a Titan too.

00:32.365 --> 00:34.617
Man, Mikasa's incredible...

00:35.035 --> 00:36.953
How can she move so fast?

00:37.287 --> 00:40.040
No! She's not her usual,
composed self at all!

00:40.290 --> 00:42.083
I'll do whatever it takes to win!

00:42.292 --> 00:44.127
Whatever it takes to live!

00:45.378 --> 00:48.381
Mikasa found herself
in dire straits as well

00:48.506 --> 00:51.760
when a mysterious Titan
appeared and attacked another Titan.

02:37.866 --> 02:38.700
There!

02:38.783 --> 02:41.953
Your mobility gear still works,
and I've given you all my blades.

02:42.370 --> 02:45.582
All I ask is that you leave me
with this one.

02:46.749 --> 02:50.920
I would rather not get eaten alive
if I can.

02:57.093 --> 02:58.928
No way...

03:00.138 --> 03:01.055
Armin.

03:03.725 --> 03:05.852
I'm not leaving you here.

03:09.647 --> 03:13.109
But the place is swarming with Titans.

03:13.192 --> 03:15.194
You can't possibly carry someone
while jumping...

03:15.278 --> 03:16.195
Let's go!

03:18.364 --> 03:19.282
No...

03:20.199 --> 03:21.284
Please don't...

03:21.993 --> 03:23.453
I'll only...

03:24.287 --> 03:27.123
I'll only get more of my friends killed!

03:38.718 --> 03:39.636
Wait!

03:39.969 --> 03:42.096
Listen! I have a suggestion!

03:42.513 --> 03:43.681
A suggestion?

03:45.725 --> 03:49.854
Only you two can do it,
so I leave the choice to you...

03:50.730 --> 03:52.065
I know it sounds crazy,

03:52.857 --> 03:54.776
but could we use
that Titan to our advantage?

03:55.151 --> 03:56.319
That Titan?

03:56.694 --> 04:00.490
It attacks other Titans
and doesn't show any interest in us.

04:00.782 --> 04:04.869
So I'm wondering if we could lead it
to the supply building...

04:05.620 --> 04:09.832
If it takes out the other Titans for us,
we might all survive!

04:10.708 --> 04:14.462
"Lead it"?
How do you plan to lead that thing?

04:14.796 --> 04:17.423
My guess is it's fighting on instinct.

04:17.799 --> 04:21.427
If you two take out the Titans around it,

04:21.928 --> 04:25.348
it will go and look for other Titans.

04:25.682 --> 04:27.934
That will naturally lead it toward HQ.

04:28.685 --> 04:31.187
We can't risk our necks
for some hopeful guess!

04:31.604 --> 04:34.607
But if it works, we can eliminate
all the Titans attacking HQ

04:34.691 --> 04:36.651
in one fell swoop!

04:38.319 --> 04:40.530
- It seems worth trying.
- What?

04:40.613 --> 04:41.614
Are you serious?

04:42.031 --> 04:45.743
It's better to take a gamble
than wait for our inevitable deaths.

04:46.369 --> 04:48.121
Let's go with Armin's suggestion.

04:49.289 --> 04:51.666
You want us to fight Titans with a Titan?

04:52.208 --> 04:54.210
Yes, I do.

04:57.380 --> 04:59.382
If we fail, we'll be a laughingstock.

05:00.883 --> 05:03.803
But if we succeed, everyone survives.

05:04.387 --> 05:05.596
It all comes down to resolve.

05:08.141 --> 05:10.226
All right! Fine!

05:16.190 --> 05:17.942
Am I really cut out for this?

05:19.944 --> 05:23.406
Am I really fit to have
a position of responsibility?

05:29.370 --> 05:30.204
No!

05:31.039 --> 05:33.750
No... Now is the time.

05:34.584 --> 05:38.463
Now is our chance, while the Titans
are preoccupied over there!

05:41.424 --> 05:42.258
Now!

05:43.676 --> 05:45.470
Make for HQ while we have the chance!

05:57.065 --> 05:58.149
Now is our only chance!

05:58.524 --> 06:00.568
If we run out of gas,
it's all over anyway!

06:01.819 --> 06:03.404
Everyone, charge!

06:50.701 --> 06:52.078
- Jean!
- What?

06:52.370 --> 06:55.123
Thanks! You helped us get away!

06:55.373 --> 06:56.207
What?

06:56.582 --> 06:57.750
It's all thanks to you!

06:57.834 --> 07:01.254
It's like I said before!
You make a good leader!

07:02.547 --> 07:04.757
I'm not so sure about that!

07:14.350 --> 07:15.184
Damn!

07:33.786 --> 07:36.122
How many made it?

07:38.791 --> 07:40.418
How many comrades' deaths did I use?

07:41.043 --> 07:44.297
How many people died because of my orders?

07:54.765 --> 07:58.186
You're with the supply team, aren't you?

07:58.686 --> 07:59.604
Yes...

08:03.274 --> 08:04.275
Stop, Jean!

08:04.442 --> 08:07.528
They are the ones who abandoned us!

08:07.653 --> 08:10.448
People are dead because of you guys!

08:10.531 --> 08:13.117
The Titans overran the supply room!

08:13.326 --> 08:14.911
There was nothing we could do!

08:14.994 --> 08:18.289
It's your job to deal with them, anyway!

08:21.250 --> 08:22.168
Get down!

08:28.508 --> 08:29.425
Crap!

08:30.176 --> 08:32.011
There are too many people!

08:33.054 --> 08:34.555
- Hurry!
- Get further inside!

08:34.639 --> 08:36.474
Stop! We can't all go at once!

08:36.557 --> 08:38.017
Where did Mikasa go?

08:38.100 --> 08:40.478
She ran out of gas!
She's long gone by now!

08:41.812 --> 08:43.147
This is normal...

08:43.689 --> 08:45.983
This must be what
the real world is like...

08:46.984 --> 08:50.863
Was I trying to delude myself until now?

08:51.656 --> 08:55.701
I knew what the real world was like...

08:56.827 --> 08:59.997
It's so obvious when you think about it.

09:01.415 --> 09:05.545
We don't stand a chance
against these monstrosities.

09:15.221 --> 09:16.138
What?

09:27.275 --> 09:28.109
What?

09:28.776 --> 09:30.695
What the hell...

09:34.824 --> 09:35.825
Mikasa!

09:35.908 --> 09:38.494
Man, that was close.
It's completely empty.

09:39.161 --> 09:41.872
We did it! We managed to make it!

09:42.707 --> 09:45.585
You're alive!

09:45.793 --> 09:47.420
- We did it, Armin!
- That hurts!

09:47.503 --> 09:49.839
Your plan worked!

09:50.339 --> 09:51.173
Guys!

09:51.257 --> 09:53.968
That Titan's an Abnormal!
It's killing all the other Titans!

09:54.510 --> 09:57.179
And it has no interest in us!

09:57.972 --> 10:01.726
We can use it to our advantage
to escape from here!

10:02.727 --> 10:04.687
Use a Titan?

10:04.770 --> 10:07.148
A Titan is helping us?

10:07.481 --> 10:10.192
- What kind of nonsensical dream--
- It's no dream.

10:11.110 --> 10:13.321
Whether it's an Abnormal or not,
I don't care.

10:13.696 --> 10:17.158
We're going to let it rampage here
for as long as possible.

10:21.912 --> 10:28.252
Because, realistically,
that's our best strategy for survival now.

10:40.306 --> 10:41.140
It's okay.

10:41.849 --> 10:44.518
That Titan's tougher
than the ordinary ones.

10:48.731 --> 10:50.608
I doubt they'll take down this building

10:51.525 --> 10:53.444
while that one's rampaging like crazy.

10:55.988 --> 10:59.617
How much do you know about that Titan?

11:01.285 --> 11:03.371
We can worry about that after we're safe.

11:04.372 --> 11:07.375
Yes. Let's get out of here first.

11:07.875 --> 11:08.709
We found some!

11:09.627 --> 11:11.504
They belong to the Military Police!

11:12.171 --> 11:13.798
The damn things are all covered in dust.

11:16.175 --> 11:18.594
Are you sure buckshot
is what we want to use?

11:19.595 --> 11:21.138
I mean, seriously...

11:22.181 --> 11:25.476
Will guns even work against Titans?

11:27.978 --> 11:30.022
They're far better than nothing, I think.

11:30.898 --> 11:34.652
If there are still seven
three-meter Titans in the supply room,

11:35.027 --> 11:39.448
this much firepower should be capable
of blinding them all simultaneously.

11:40.324 --> 11:44.662
First, we'll use the lift to lower
a group of people from the center.

11:44.912 --> 11:49.458
They will then fire simultaneously
at the faces of each of the seven Titans,

11:49.542 --> 11:50.668
which will blind them.

11:51.293 --> 11:55.131
Then comes the moment of truth.

11:56.298 --> 11:58.217
Seven people hiding above

11:58.300 --> 12:01.637
will strike the Titans' vital points
just after the guns fire.

12:02.555 --> 12:07.226
In other words, this plan
will put everything on the line,

12:07.685 --> 12:09.353
everyone's lives on the line,

12:09.728 --> 12:11.188
for a single attack.

12:12.523 --> 12:16.902
Seven people will have to slay
seven Titans at the same time.

12:18.696 --> 12:23.784
It'll be up to the seven soldiers who are
most physically fit and adept.

12:24.577 --> 12:29.832
So, I'm sorry for placing
everyone's lives on your shoulders.

12:30.374 --> 12:31.584
It's no problem.

12:31.792 --> 12:36.046
If we fail, we die. It's the same risk,
regardless of who goes.

12:36.130 --> 12:42.303
Still, is this shabby idea of mine
really our best strategy?

12:42.970 --> 12:48.392
We've got no other choice.
We're out of time and options.

12:48.851 --> 12:50.644
All we can do now is to give it our all!

12:50.936 --> 12:53.772
It will be fine. Don't worry.

12:54.690 --> 12:57.109
You have a knack for
finding correct solutions.

12:57.193 --> 12:58.027
What?

12:58.194 --> 13:01.697
You even used it to save
my life and Eren's before.

13:02.198 --> 13:05.201
I did? When?

13:06.994 --> 13:08.704
The lift's ready!

13:08.954 --> 13:11.665
The guns too! They're all loaded!

13:11.999 --> 13:13.375
You just don't realize it.

13:13.792 --> 13:15.920
- We can talk about it later.
- Okay.

13:18.339 --> 13:23.260
Still, can we really take out
all the Titans without our ODM gear?

13:23.761 --> 13:24.887
Of course we can!

13:24.970 --> 13:27.097
These Titans are only
three or four meters tall.

13:27.306 --> 13:29.391
Targeting their vitals will be a cinch.

13:29.642 --> 13:30.476
Yes.

13:30.768 --> 13:34.688
Regardless of size, their vitals go
from the head to the nape of the neck...

13:34.772 --> 13:37.399
A meter high and ten centimeters across!

13:37.775 --> 13:40.528
You can also shove
one of these up their asses!

13:40.986 --> 13:42.696
Those are their only two weak spots!

13:42.988 --> 13:45.616
I never knew about that one!

13:45.783 --> 13:48.327
This is the first I've heard of it, too.

13:48.536 --> 13:49.620
Reiner.

13:50.079 --> 13:53.374
Those could end up
being your last words, you know.

14:06.971 --> 14:09.807
Good. Their numbers haven't increased.

14:15.479 --> 14:17.106
Proceeding with the operation!

14:27.074 --> 14:29.702
Stay calm! We need to lure them
all the way in!

14:34.832 --> 14:35.666
Steady...

14:38.752 --> 14:40.546
Avoid a disadvantageous fight.

14:41.547 --> 14:43.549
If you don't want anyone to die...

14:44.383 --> 14:46.427
make this attack count!

14:47.970 --> 14:48.971
Steady...

14:57.730 --> 14:58.731
Ready...

15:04.904 --> 15:06.071
Fire!

15:15.289 --> 15:16.206
I got mine!

15:16.290 --> 15:17.291
How about you guys?

15:27.217 --> 15:28.677
I'm...

15:29.303 --> 15:31.555
- I'm sorry for suddenly sneaking up...
- Crap...

15:31.889 --> 15:34.016
I'm very sorry...

15:34.558 --> 15:35.809
Sasha and Conny...

15:36.018 --> 15:37.436
Hurry! Give them backup!

15:39.855 --> 15:42.733
I'm...

15:43.692 --> 15:45.277
I'm very sorry!

15:57.456 --> 15:59.458
Mikasa!

15:59.750 --> 16:01.043
You saved me!

16:02.044 --> 16:03.045
Are you all right?

16:03.212 --> 16:04.129
Thanks to you!

16:04.213 --> 16:05.589
Then get up.

16:06.131 --> 16:07.132
I owe you one.

16:07.549 --> 16:08.384
No problem.

16:08.676 --> 16:09.760
Oh, man.

16:10.552 --> 16:12.012
That was a close call, Annie.

16:12.721 --> 16:14.807
I'm really glad you didn't end up hurt.

16:15.474 --> 16:16.725
They've all been slain!

16:17.476 --> 16:18.894
Switch to resupply work!

16:19.228 --> 16:20.145
We did it!

16:26.360 --> 16:29.863
- All right! We're going to survive!
- And no more Titans are coming inside!

16:30.114 --> 16:32.241
All thanks to that
berserk Titan out there!

16:34.660 --> 16:36.954
I caved in to that Titan...

16:37.621 --> 16:39.748
I'm too ashamed to face the others...

16:39.832 --> 16:41.542
There'll be plenty of time
to sneer at you later!

16:41.625 --> 16:42.751
For now, we've got to escape!

16:44.378 --> 16:47.131
I can't see myself as much of a leader.

16:48.007 --> 16:49.633
Don't talk like that anymore.

16:54.096 --> 16:56.181
I don't mean any offense by this,

16:57.349 --> 16:59.351
but I think the fact
that you aren't strong

16:59.977 --> 17:02.438
really lets you understand
how the weak feel.

17:03.063 --> 17:07.067
And your skill at analyzing
a situation as it unfolds

17:07.401 --> 17:10.487
gives you a clear grasp
of what needs to be done, you know?

17:12.448 --> 17:14.158
You made the right call.

17:14.950 --> 17:17.828
It got me moving. It's why I'm alive now.

17:24.543 --> 17:26.754
Is everyone ready? It's time to scram!

17:27.296 --> 17:30.090
- Let's move!
- Scale the wall!

17:30.215 --> 17:31.800
Rendezvous with the main forces!

17:34.219 --> 17:35.054
Mikasa?

17:39.600 --> 17:40.517
Mikasa!

17:41.018 --> 17:42.269
We have to get out of here!

17:42.895 --> 17:43.979
That Titan...

17:48.150 --> 17:49.401
They're cannibalizing it?

17:52.905 --> 17:55.240
I guess it can't regenerate its body?

17:56.700 --> 17:59.578
I thought that if we could somehow
figure out what's up with that Titan,

18:00.537 --> 18:05.626
it could've helped us break free
from this hopeless situation.

18:06.043 --> 18:07.044
I agree.

18:07.920 --> 18:11.173
We'll learn nothing at all
if it ends up getting eaten!

18:11.715 --> 18:15.427
For now, we have to get
rid of the ones clinging to it

18:15.886 --> 18:17.304
and help keep it alive!

18:17.387 --> 18:18.889
Are you insane, Reiner?

18:18.972 --> 18:21.558
We can finally get our asses out of here!

18:21.683 --> 18:26.563
And what if there's a chance
that Titan could become our ally?

18:27.022 --> 18:29.983
It would be a weapon more powerful
than any cannon, wouldn't you agree?

18:31.151 --> 18:32.361
An ally...

18:32.778 --> 18:34.071
Are you actually serious?

18:36.073 --> 18:37.407
That one...

18:38.242 --> 18:40.744
That's the Abnormal that ate Thomas!

19:15.195 --> 19:16.196
Oh, man...

19:21.493 --> 19:23.370
What was it you wanted to save again?

19:31.211 --> 19:34.256
Looks like it's finished for good.

19:35.048 --> 19:37.467
All right, that's enough! Let's get going!

19:37.551 --> 19:40.012
As if that monster would ever be our ally.

19:40.387 --> 19:42.014
A Titan's a Titan.

19:47.019 --> 19:48.437
What's with you guys?

20:12.961 --> 20:13.879
Mikasa!

21:23.573 --> 21:24.783
It's Eren...

21:26.868 --> 21:31.039
His severed arm and leg are back...

21:32.582 --> 21:36.962
He had been swallowed
by a Titan back then...

21:37.796 --> 21:38.964
Back then...

21:48.348 --> 21:51.018
How is this possible?

21:59.526 --> 22:05.532
Does this mean Eren did all this?

23:43.046 --> 23:45.006
"I'm going to drive out the Titans."

23:45.549 --> 23:49.636
That strong emotion
transformed Eren into a Titan.

23:50.178 --> 23:54.683
However, the Garrison Regiment
deems him a threat to humanity

23:54.766 --> 23:56.184
and turns its swords against him.
